    <div class="maker"><b>Nippon Industrial Noise</b><span>Building New Futures</span></div>
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="hero-text">
    <div class="title">
      <div class="kanji" lang="ja" aria-hidden="true">震度ヴェルシオ</div>
      <h1>Shindo Versio</h1>
      <div class="tagline">Seismic Rumble &amp; Texture Engine</div>
    </div>
    <p class="lede">Shindo Versio converts any kick drum into responsive rumble and texture layers, ducking them out of the way on every hit.</p>
    <p>Feed it a clean kick. The signal flow delays the audio to lock the groove before fracturing it into a sustained reverb cloud. A bi-directional, DJ-style filter dials in the character, shifting from dark low-pass weight to bright high-pass grit while the integrated sidechain clamps the output on every hit. Three selectable engines vary the texture of the space. The layout remains strictly one knob per function, with seven dedicated CV inputs mapping directly to the front panel. Nothing is hidden in a menu.</p>
    <div class="eyebrow">Eurorack firmware · Noise Engineering Versio · 10 HP</div>
